@format 1
@id tabs.rename
@title Rename tab
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Commit an edited tab name, normalize it against existing names, and refresh dependent titles.
@section I. UI
@tabs Global interface
@flow TB
@related tabs.add

@alias navigator = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PTabNavigator
@alias tabset = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.LTabset

[input] Tab name committed <input>
- Receive the edited name from keyboard or focus completion @ navigator.PTabNameCommit(...)
> normalize

[normalize] Resolve usable name <process>
- Normalize the requested name and avoid duplicate visible titles @ tabset.LTabsetNameSet(...)
- Refresh titles derived from the tab set @ tabset.LTabsetTitleUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Tab renamed <output>
= The tab and operations that read its title use the resolved name.
